---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="How We Can Help — Sustainabox" description="Stay, learn, consult. Access real experience from the people who designed and built Sustainabox — so you can make better decisions on your own build." image="/images/Interior-1.jpg">

	<header class="page-hero" style="background-image: url('/images/Interior-1.jpg');">
		<div class="page-hero-inner">
			<span class="eyebrow">Offerings</span>
			<h1>How We Can Help</h1>
			<p>Whether you're curious about container homes or planning your own build, we're here to help you avoid expensive mistakes and make better decisions.</p>
		</div>
	</header>

	<section class="container content-section">

		<div class="offerings-grid">

			<!-- Stay & Learn -->
			<div class="offering-card">
				<span class="eyebrow">Experience</span>
				<h2>Stay &amp; Learn</h2>
				<p>Spend a weekend at Sustainabox and experience container living firsthand. Every stay includes access to our in-depth build walkthrough and the opportunity to ask questions about every part of the project.</p>
				<p class="best-for"><strong>Best for:</strong> People exploring container homes before starting their own project.</p>
				<a href="/stays" class="btn btn-primary">Learn More</a>
			</div>

			<!-- Build Walkthrough -->
			<div class="offering-card">
				<span class="eyebrow">Education</span>
				<h2>Build Walkthrough</h2>
				<p>Our recorded four-hour walkthrough covers the entire build — from site preparation and container modifications to insulation, utilities, finishes, and everything in between.</p>
				<p class="best-for"><strong>Best for:</strong> DIY builders who want to learn at their own pace.</p>
				<a href="/course" class="btn btn-primary">Learn More</a>
			</div>

			<!-- Consulting -->
			<div class="offering-card">
				<span class="eyebrow">1:1 Support</span>
				<h2>Consulting</h2>
				<p>Need another set of experienced eyes? Whether you're reviewing plans, deciding between options, or working through a challenge during construction, we offer one-on-one consulting tailored to your project.</p>
				<ul class="topic-list">
					<li>Design reviews</li>
					<li>Build sequencing</li>
					<li>Material selection</li>
					<li>Budget planning</li>
					<li>Lessons learned</li>
					<li>Problem solving</li>
				</ul>
				<a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary">Get in Touch</a>
			</div>

			<!-- Digital Resources -->
			<div class="offering-card offering-card--muted">
				<span class="eyebrow coming-soon-tag">Coming Soon</span>
				<h2>Digital Resources</h2>
				<p>We're turning everything we created during the build into downloadable resources, including budget templates, planning checklists, build documentation, and project planning tools.</p>
				<p>Join our newsletter to be the first to know — and to tell us what you actually need.</p>
				<a href="mailto:jenswid@gmail.com,codyswid@gmail.com?subject=Sustainabox%20Resources%20Newsletter" class="btn btn-outline">Get Notified</a>
			</div>

		</div>

		<!-- Resiliency Review — Full Width Featured -->
		<div class="offering-featured">
			<div class="offering-featured-inner">
				<div class="featured-label">
					<span class="eyebrow">Unique to Sustainabox</span>
				</div>
				<div class="featured-content">
					<h2>Resiliency Review</h2>
					<p>How resilient is your home? We'll review your plans for power outages, water interruptions, severe weather, maintenance, long-term durability, and operational risk — not just building code.</p>
					<p>Most container home consultants can tell you where to put insulation. Very few can think systematically about how a home performs over decades, how systems fail, or how to design for resilience without adding unnecessary complexity. That's what we bring.</p>
					<p class="best-for"><strong>Best for:</strong> Builders who want their home to perform well long after move-in, not just pass inspection.</p>
					<a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary">Get in Touch</a>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>

	</section>

	<!-- CTA -->
	<section class="cta-section">
		<div class="container">
			<h2>Not Sure Where to Start?</h2>
			<p>Reach out and we'll point you in the right direction.</p>
			<a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary">Contact Us</a>
		</div>
	</section>

</Layout>

<style>
	.content-section {
		padding: 4rem 0;
	}

	/* 2-column card grid */
	.offerings-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
		gap: 2rem;
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
	}

	.offering-card {
		background: white;
		border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
		border-top: 3px solid var(--color-blue);
		border-radius: 4px;
		padding: 2.5rem;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
	}

	.offering-card--muted {
		border-top-color: #cbd5e0;
		background: var(--color-warm);
	}

	.offering-card h2 {
		color: var(--color-navy);
		font-size: 1.4rem;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
	}

	.offering-card p {
		color: var(--color-muted);
		line-height: 1.8;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
		font-size: 0.95rem;
		flex-grow: 1;
	}

	.offering-card .btn {
		align-self: flex-start;
		margin-top: auto;
	}

	/* Featured full-width block */
	.offering-featured {
		background: var(--color-navy);
		border-radius: 4px;
		padding: 3rem;
		margin-bottom: 0;
	}

	.offering-featured-inner {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 200px 1fr;
		gap: 3rem;
		align-items: start;
	}

	.featured-label {
		padding-top: 0.25rem;
	}

	.featured-label .eyebrow {
		color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
	}

	.featured-content h2 {
		color: white;
		font-size: 1.6rem;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
	}

	.featured-content p {
		color: rgba(255,255,255,0.8);
		line-height: 1.8;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
		font-size: 0.95rem;
	}

	.featured-content .best-for strong {
		color: white;
	}

	.featured-content .btn-primary {
		background: white;
		color: var(--color-navy);
		margin-top: 0.5rem;
	}

	.best-for {
		font-size: 0.9rem !important;
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem !important;
	}

	.best-for strong {
		color: var(--color-navy);
	}

	.topic-list {
		list-style: none;
		padding: 0;
		margin: 0.5rem 0 1.5rem;
	}

	.topic-list li {
		padding: 0.3rem 0 0.3rem 1.25rem;
		position: relative;
		color: var(--color-muted);
		font-size: 0.9rem;
	}

	.topic-list li::before {
		content: "→";
		position: absolute;
		left: 0;
		color: var(--color-blue);
		font-weight: 600;
	}

	.coming-soon-tag {
		background: var(--color-rust);
		color: white;
		padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem;
		border-radius: 2px;
		font-size: 0.7rem;
		letter-spacing: 0.12em;
	}

	/* CTA */
	.cta-section {
		padding: 5rem 0;
		background: var(--color-navy);
		text-align: center;
		color: white;
	}

	.cta-section h2 {
		color: white;
		margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
	}

	.cta-section p {
		color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85);
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
		font-size: 1.05rem;
	}

	.cta-section .btn-primary {
		background: white;
		color: var(--color-navy);
	}

	@media (max-width: 768px) {
		.offerings-grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}

		.offering-featured-inner {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			gap: 1rem;
		}

		.offering-featured {
			padding: 2rem;
		}
	}
</style>
